        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIqWkNceAIBKR8c8SDxiHy101C2PB6qdHJ3lOJyNdhzRRlK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "The team at David's Tea Vaudreuil is amazing! They really know what they are selling. Every time I have gone there they know what to recommend even with all my allergies. They take the time to be with you and listen. Allison is totally amazing and knowledgeable and Tyler has also amazing . They have both helped us many times!  Thank You !",
        "time": 1769216336,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115314039935890902869/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVC-KxWRCVF765WLJyc_D4yi1DvI9vbA7TgJcwyDaSFSk1o7gPn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Allison has helped my parents out a lot with finding great teas in the last; i’ve also had really great service from her!\n\nToday I had excellent service from Megan. She helped me look at lots of options and showed off the teas on sale. Really appreciate the suggestions!\n\nThank you to the both of them!",
        "time": 1769457201,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Katie Hope",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101342011053730827027/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIdzTREC-_PiRfdBTpNKiGJM1mp41B1_G5jo_OLtmi43zotdZTq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Stopped in for a quick Christmas gift and the girls working were amazing. They recommended some great ideas and a few tasty drinks! Also taught\nMy kids about teas and found them the perfect drink!\nThanks Trina, Allison and can’t remember the last girls name.",
        "time": 1765240686,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M KAD",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111325334650206048893/reviews",
