        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Just visited David's Tea and had an amazing experience! Jenna was an incredible representative - super friendly,\n-knowledgeable,\n- helpful.\nShe took the time to explain the different tea options and made some fantastic recommendations. The service was top-notch and I left feeling happy and satisfied. I highly recommend stopping by and asking for Jenna!",
        "time": 1751656052,
        "translated": false
      },
